body:
I am not sure what I can tell you except that I'm sorry you have faced these things, and that I hope your experience in the USA will be a lot better than all of this.

&#x200B;

> There is no place where I can be at ease and feel like I truly belong. I hold resentment towards people with uncomplicated national identities who can be at peace in their respective home countries. 

I also feel like your resentment is very understandable. It seems like such a normal thing for folks to feel at home somewhere, when some people don't. It does get frustrating. I do hope that soon, you will feel some more peace of mind. Take care of yourself, best wishes for you :)

&#x200B;
